cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: Bulk RNA-seq Quantification
abstract: Trims bulk RNA-seq reads with fastp, quantifies transcripts with salmon against an rnaseq-index
  index and sums them to genes as tximport's lengthScaledTPM, writing an integer gene count table, TPM,
  a sample table with QC numbers and SPARC metadata, and salmon's per-sample transcript estimates.
